 "entities": {},
 "insight": [
  "The value per kg of Luxembourg's intra-EU imports from the EU27 partner group increased from 0.51 euros in 2005 to 1.23 euros in 2025.",
  "This represents a rise of 138.7% over the 20-year period, with a median value of 0.87 euros per kg between 2005 and 2025.",
  "The largest year-on-year increase occurred between 2009 and 2010, when the value rose from 0.56 euros to 0.80 euros per kg.",
  "Compared to imports from non-EU27 countries, which had a much higher value per kg, the gap narrowed from 23.1 times in 2005 to 16.1 times in 2025.",
  "However, these values only cover trade rows where quantities are known, as quantities are missing for part of the trade."
 ],
